OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScotland, Northern Ireland,
OL,6,Fnorthwest England and northwest Wales
OL,7,Fwill have a windy day with showery
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain, this turning heavy
OL,9,Fand persistent at times. After a
OL,10,Fchilly start elsewhere, it will be
OL,11,Fmostly dry with some warm sunshine
OL,12,Fdeveloping.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA weakening band of rain will
OL,15,Fmove southeastwards into England and
OL,16,FWales overnight. Clear spells and a
OL,17,Ffew showers to the northwest. Clear
OL,18,Fspells and fog patches in the
OL,19,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
