OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FSome rain across the north
OL,6,Fand west of Scotland on Saturday, and
OL,7,Fsome showers affecting central and
OL,8,Fsouthwest England and southeast Wales.
OL,9,FOtherwise fine with some warm spells
OL,10,Fof sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
